1 NOTE <p>!bapt record SL film #        sponsors were michael mcbride and mary mcelhare Information from him to James Logue Jr. in Valley forge.  He said that the Logues were decended from the Martle?? of th
2 CONC e Nine Hostages. He was a piolot on Lock Swilly and he was the last of 250 years to be a true river boat piolot.  Alot of what he knew was passed on to Paddy his son. He was the person who James Logue
2 CONC  stayed with in Ireland.</p><p><p>From: John Logue (1902-1983, Largenreagh, Downing’s, Donegal, Ireland)</p></p><p><p>To: J. Owen Logue, 5029 Newhall St., Phila, PA.</p></p><p><p></p></p><p><p>Dear 
2 CONC Mr. Logue:</p></p><p><p>Just Received today 26 Jan 1975 asking for information about all your relatives, First Your Great Grand Pa was born in Dundoan (Dundooan) in or around 1832.  That’s my grand 
2 CONC Pa.; my father was Patrick Logue, Son of James Logue your Great Grand Pa.   Your’s Great Grand Pa’s Family were first My Father Patrick Logue, Dan Logue John Logue, Annie Logue, Hugh, James, Owen,
2 CONC  Peter, Mary and Michael all Logues.</p><p><p>My father was born 1875 that was the oldest member of Great Grand Pa’s Family, Then there was 10 of a family, Say about, Say about, Say about  1 ½  Yea
2 CONC rs between of them 1 ½  Years between each one that would be each one that would be each one that would be December  the youngest Michael, around born 1895 leaving about 1 ½ year between each one.</
2 CONC p><p><p>As to Cardinal Logue say, I always heard my Grand Pa say he was his 2nd or 3rd Cousin.  Your Grand Pa was my Father’s Brother.  </p></p><p><p>Now my own brothers and sisters firsts James he 
2 CONC lives in New Jersey, My brother Michael died of an accident in Bayonne New Jersey in 1930, and was buried in your grandfather’s plot in Philadelphia.   Lived in Betty my sister lived in Wynnewood, h
2 CONC is married name is Maguire.  Sophia lived at home and Mary Ann in London, England.</p><p><p>That my brothers and sisters, now my own Sons and Daughters, Susie the Oldest lived in Londonderry Married. 
2 CONC  Michael, Owen and Mary they are living in London, England.  Seamus at the moment lives in the Bronx; New York his address is Apt 2, 2725 Sedgewick Ave., Bronx, New York.</p><p><p>He is the youngest o
2 CONC f my family you might sometime get in touch with him.  You will understand your grand PA was my Uncle, I do hope you will understand all I have said heretofore, in your query.</p></p><p><p>Will you pl
2 CONC ease write soon and let me know if all of this is satisfactory to you.  Now any time you want to come to Ireland you come to our home, and let us know in advance if you would consider coming.  We will
2 CONC  be all glad to see you.  </p><p><p>So god bless you for now and write please,</p></p><p><p></p></p><p><p>Yours Sincerely,</p></p><p><p>John Logue [1902-1983]</p></p><p><p>[Parenthesis added my me to 
2 CONC explain as needed the who’s and why’s]</p></p><p></p>
