2 CONC English and Irish. Dad remembers him as living in Donies in Ballymichael, and possibly being a bit simple." He used to sit in the chair up in the corner " according to Dad. His date of birth is from t
2 CONC he LDS site and  - hoping that it is for the correct Daniel, notes that he was born in Rosnakill which tallies with the story that the family were evicted at some point and had to live in Rosnakill fo
2 CONC r a period before being allowed back to the farm in Ballymichael.</p><p></p>
