1 NOTE <p>DF</p><p><p>Notes for JOHN (JOHNNY DONIE) FRIEL:</p></p><p><p>John is noted as a Farmers Son in the 1901 Census and as a labourer in the 1911 Census. Dad remembers him vaguely as a child. Eileen Ca
2 CONC rragher thinks that he died circa 1932 as she remembers a holiday in Ballymichael being cancelled due to Johnnie's death. His date of birth is from the LDS site and confirm that he was born in Ballymi
2 CONC chael. Eileen also said that he had been in the US with Eddie.</p><p><p></p></p><p></p>
